"\n"
"A real installation will create a machine-local MOK. After reboot, choose Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes in MOKManager and enter password 123456."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"En verklig installation kommer att skapa en maskinlokal MOK. Efter omstart väljer du Registrera MOK → Fortsätt → Ja i MOKManager och anger lösenordet 123456."

msgid ""
"\n"
"On the blue MOKManager screen choose Enroll MOK → Continue → Yes, password: 123456"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"På den blå MOKManager-skärmen väljer du Registrera MOK → Fortsätt → Ja, lösenord: 123456"

msgid "(Live USB — excluded)"
msgstr "(Live USB — exkluderad)"

msgid "4 GiB disk swap (priority 10) + 50% RAM LZ4 zram (priority 100)"
msgstr "4 GiB diskbyte (prioritet 10) + 50 % RAM LZ4 zram (prioritet 100)"

